    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824210/extras/883bcdc11d12997a3cb0facdae9fc91d.webp?t=1741252501\" width=600 height=44 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824210/extras/6cd81bbcaa49040bb9028a41103f0f44.webp?t=1741252501\" width=350 height=39 /></span><br>The Cursed Legacy is a Puzzle Game set in a dark and mysterious atmosphere. Keep calm and solve the riddles to unravel this strange disappearance. But be careful, you're not alone!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Investigate and Gather clues</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824210/extras/7076914dfa64abf07d69f7a547e600c7.poster.avif?t=1741252501\" width=600 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824210/extras/7076914dfa64abf07d69f7a547e600c7.webm?t=1741252501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824210/extras/7076914dfa64abf07d69f7a547e600c7.mp4?t=1741252501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve the riddles</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824210/extras/670e1271fe0589fe2c367ec3c82b25ad.poster.avif?t=1741252501\" width=600 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824210/extras/670e1271fe0589fe2c367ec3c82b25ad.webm?t=1741252501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824210/extras/670e1271fe0589fe2c367ec3c82b25ad.mp4?t=1741252501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover the story And... survive</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824210/extras/34d96659e5347d4f8a526adbb7fa88a6.poster.avif?t=1741252501\" width=600 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824210/extras/34d96659e5347d4f8a526adbb7fa88a6.webm?t=1741252501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824210/extras/34d96659e5347d4f8a526adbb7fa88a6.mp4?t=1741252501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Developer</h2><i>After battling evil entities on This is a Ghost, I wanted to focus on another project I'm passionate about: The Cursed Legacy. This game, with its original story, is the first chapter in a horrific experience rich in mystery, black powder and demonic creatures.<br><br>Nuci</i>",
